/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Our group's line follower project goes beyond conventional functionality by incorporating a seed dropping mechanism. While autonomously tracing lines, it also disperses seeds along its path, offering an innovative solution for agricultural tasks.  The seed dropper mechanism operates efficiently through a cascading series of mechanical actions: as the line follower wheel rotates, it engages with another mechanical component, aligning perforations to enable seed release at precise intervals.)
/E (Our group's line follower project goes beyond conventional functionality by incorporating a seed dropping mechanism. While autonomously tracing lines, it also disperses seeds along its path, offering an innovative solution for agricultural tasks.  The seed dropper mechanism operates efficiently through a cascading series of mechanical actions: as the line follower wheel rotates, it engages with another mechanical component, aligning perforations to enable seed release at precise intervals.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
